  "flow_summary": "The interviewer was patient and persistent in guiding a difficult, confused patient, but the interaction suffered from significant mechanical repetition and a failure to adapt to the patient's confusion. The interviewer frequently repeated the exact same question multiple times in the PHQ-9 and GAD-7 sections, even after the patient expressed confusion, rather than simplifying the language or clarifying the task.",
