      "evidence": "In the GAD-7 section, the interviewer repeated the exact same question phrasing three times (turns 7, 8, and 9) despite the patient explicitly stating they did not understand the distinction between frequency and severity."
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "category": "mechanical_flow",
      "evidence": "The interviewer often used a rigid, scripted approach to 'reminding' the patient to answer the previous question (e.g., 'قبل أن ننتقل، هل يمكنك الإجابة على السؤال أعلاه؟'), which felt robotic and failed to build rapport with a clearly struggling patient."
